      "description": "Find and collect sculptures across Portland while unlocking exciting rewards and milestones along the way. Discover the design inspiration and vote for your favourite. Share your photos to the sculpture photo galleries while tracking your steps and miles. Keep up to date with the latest trail related news and events. \n\nArt trail app includes: map, sculpture listings, artist bios, design inspiration, sculpture and milestone rewards, sculpture photo galleries, voting, trail stats, social sharing and event listings.\n\nWildwood: Follow the Crows is a Wild in Art event presented by LAIKA, benefiting OHSU Doernbecher Children’s Hospital.\n\nWild in Art is a leading creative producer of spectacular, mass-appeal public art events, which connect businesses, artists and communities through the power of creativity and innovation.\n\nFor 20 years, LAIKA has pioneered the field of animation--creating award-winning films, handcrafted by visionaries and artists. We're raising the bar, pushing boudaries, and redefining the kinds of stories this artform can tell. \n\nFor 100 years, OHSU Doernbecher Children’s Hospital has changed young lives through expert care and the unwavering support of its community. From the very beginning, Doernbecher made a simple but powerful promise: to care for every child in need.\n\nFor 38 years, Downtown Portland Clean & Safe has worked to help create a cleaner, safer, and more welcoming downtown. As some of downtown’s biggest champions, the organization also leads the Visit Downtown campaign, inviting people to experience all that Portland’s central city has to offer.",
